    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// The marks a Baroque page is covered in (docs/plan/prompts/70)." },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "//" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// Every mark here is written and none is realized. A trill on this page says" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// \"trill\"; what notes it plays is a question Baroque and Romantic practice" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// genuinely disagree about, and settling it in the notation would be musa" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// choosing a century for the reader. The profile settles it — or nothing does," },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// and the mark is printed and not played, which is what an unrealized" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// ornament has always meant." },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "//" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// The one mark that does something is the fermata: `hold` in a profile" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// lengthens the note. It does not stop the clock — musa has no way to say" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// that until tempo becomes a fact — so the harpsichord rings on under the" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// bar rather than the bar waiting for it." },
    { "kind": "piece", "text": "piece" },
    { "kind": "string", "text": "\"Ornaments\"" },
